          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Secure Records</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
            Your medical data is encrypted, private, and HIPAA compliant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm card-hover"
